{"version":1,"key":"quest:5","content":{"id":5,"title":"对象键的排序顺序是什么？","summary":"暂未记录答案","target":{"key":"quest:5","type":"quest","id":5},"groupId":2,"groupTitle":"前端","groupColor":"mint-green","status":"resolved","answers":[],"materials":[{"index":1,"kind":"card","group":"note","title":"ES6 规定对象属性遍历顺序","meta":"","excerpt":"在 ES5 中没有规定当遍历一个对象时应该以何种顺序来访问对象的属性，但是在 ES6 中规定了访问的顺序，这个影响了 Object.getOwnPropertyNames() 和 Reflect.ownKeys()，同样也影响了调用 Object.assign 进行复制时赋值的顺序。键的顺序如下： 按照升序排序的数字按","target":{"key":"card:273","type":"card","id":273},"citeKey":"card:273"}],"trail":[{"time":1743303640422,"tone":"done","text":"标为已解决","refs":[]},{"time":1744525397800,"tone":"start","text":"提出问题","refs":[]},{"time":1744525397800,"tone":"plain","text":"关联卡片","refs":[1]}],"createTime":1744525397800,"updateTime":1744525397800,"resolvedTime":1743303640422},"meta":{"type":"quest","publishTime":1744525397800}}